WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.477
A little while later, the parade stopped.

2
00:00:13.478 --> 00:00:18.374
"Let's stay in here," whispered Mandy.

3
00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:20.002
Vinnie nodded.

4
00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:24.960
The children hid behind the silk curtain and peeked outside.

5
00:00:24.961 --> 00:00:28.715
They were stopped in front of a large open gate.

6
00:00:28.716 --> 00:00:33.544
The same symbol of two birds was mounted above the gate.

7
00:00:33.545 --> 00:00:37.078
They heard someone walk up to their box.

8
00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:40.583
"Uh-oh," whispered Vinnie.

9
00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:46.299
Between the curtains he saw a long skirt and a huge sword.

10
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.712
A man stuck his face through the curtains.

11
00:00:49.713 --> 00:00:52.487
"Come out," he ordered.

12
00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:57.941
Outside, the children noticed the man was only about seventeen.

13
00:00:57.942 --> 00:01:01.421
His hair was pulled back and tied up.

14
00:01:01.422 --> 00:01:05.544
People carrying bundles stared at the children.

15
00:01:05.545 --> 00:01:08.855
"Who are you?" the young man asked.

16
00:01:08.856 --> 00:01:12.022
The children introduced themselves.

17
00:01:12.023 --> 00:01:18.253
At that moment, an older man in a dark purple kimono appeared.

18
00:01:18.254 --> 00:01:22.799
People bowed to him and backed away respectfully.

19
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:27.072
"What is the trouble, Haruki?" the man called out.

20
00:01:27.073 --> 00:01:32.161
"Daimyo Masamune," Haruki said, bowing deeply.

21
00:01:32.162 --> 00:01:35.932
"These children were riding in one of your palanquins."

22
00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:40.075
Daimyo Masamune stared at the children.

23
00:01:40.076 --> 00:01:42.534
Vinnie and Mandy gasped.

24
00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:45.391
He had only one eye!

25
00:01:45.392 --> 00:01:48.540
"Is your father a missionary?" he asked.

26
00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.632
"A Dutch trader?"

27
00:01:50.633 --> 00:01:55.171
Vinnie and Mandy were too scared to say anything.

28
00:01:55.172 --> 00:01:58.994
"You're afraid of me, aren't you?"

29
00:01:58.995 --> 00:02:02.609
He touched his missing eye and laughed.

30
00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:07.412
"But it's clear, you have traveled to Sendai on one of my palanquins.

31
00:02:07.413 --> 00:02:08.846
No one saw you.

32
00:02:08.847 --> 00:02:10.745
No one stopped you.

33
00:02:10.746 --> 00:02:13.817
You have courage, like a samurai."

34
00:02:13.818 --> 00:02:19.517
"A samurai?" Vinnie finally spoke. "Cool!"

35
00:02:19.518 --> 00:02:25.944
Daimyo Masamune said to Haruki, "You will look after them until I return.

36
00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:29.349
I must pay a visit to Shogun Ieyasu."

37
00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:35.594
Then he added, "Do not let them leave my castle."

38
00:02:35.595 --> 00:02:36.879
"Come this way,"

39
00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:41.505
said Haruki to the children, leading them through the gate.

40
00:02:41.506 --> 00:02:45.969
"Are you a samurai?" asked Vinnie excitedly.

41
00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:50.340
"I am being trained as a samurai," Haruki replied.

42
00:02:50.341 --> 00:02:54.408
"What is a daimyo?" asked Mandy.

43
00:02:54.409 --> 00:02:57.754
"A daimyo is the master of the samurai.

44
00:02:57.755 --> 00:03:01.463
Each daimyo is given a district by the shogun.

45
00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:06.238
The samurai living in that district serve the daimyo."

46
00:03:06.239 --> 00:03:10.421
Then Mandy asked, "What is a shogun?"

47
00:03:10.422 --> 00:03:16.001
"The shogun is what you Europeans call a general," explained Haruki.

48
00:03:16.002 --> 00:03:20.126
Vinnie and Mandy walked along a high stone wall.

49
00:03:20.127 --> 00:03:26.999
The castle was huge with many houses and courtyards of different sizes.

50
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.675
Haruki climbed two low steps that led into the first house.

51
00:03:32.676 --> 00:03:35.573
Vinnie and Mandy did the same.

52
00:03:35.574 --> 00:03:39.450
Sliding doors separated the different rooms.

53
00:03:39.451 --> 00:03:43.869
Vinnie peeked inside one of the rooms as they passed.

54
00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.973
"Hey!" he shouted, staying behind.

55
00:03:47.974 --> 00:03:51.315
"What is it?" asked Mandy.

56
00:03:51.316 --> 00:03:53.255
"It's a dragon!"

57
00:03:53.256 --> 00:03:56.808
Vinnie cried, pointing into the room.

58
00:03:56.809 --> 00:03:59.643
Mandy's eyes grew big.

59
00:03:59.644 --> 00:04:06.583
A large frightening creature stood there wearing a suit of armor.
